        "title": "Glitch Techs",
        "extract": "Glitch Techs is an American animated television series created by Eric Robles and Dan Milano and produced by Nickelodeon Animation Studio for Netflix. The series premiered on Netflix on February 21, 2020, with a second season premiering on August 17 of the same year. The series was halted by Nickelodeon and Netflix after season two, leaving ten additional episodes unfinished after a production hiatus according to series co-creator Eric Robles.\n\n",
